    "accounting": "One original input load and one cumulative modeled ledger over the entire 96 ticks. Explicit pauses do not refill fuel or recharge service. Verification/replay CPU is recorded separately. The six identified sparks remain conserved across source, cargo, depot and delivered stock.",
    "report_interface": "Only a successful physical Drop emits the buffered spark bit. Capacity one prevents a later successful report from overtaking a different buffered head. Full-depot failures retain the next cargo without inventing a report. Signals are local and delayed; event clocks and case IDs are not policy observations."
