    "targeted_states": {
      "5": "courier holds spark 1",
      "9": "a report is still queued",
      "14": "keeper retains the first bit and evidence while depot holds spark 1",
      "19": "first routing changes service reserves",
      "27": "closed edge in broken-crossing",
      "47": "the same edge has reopened"
    },
    "contract": "One immutable initial world and admitted crew are advanced to increasing absolute ticks. Resume carries all cell positions/headings/registers/evidence/cargo/inboxes, source/depot stocks, beacon charge/drained/exhausted/delivered state, pending messages and IDs, link/valve state, closed edges, absolute time and cumulative costs. Earlier receipts and parent creations remain unchanged.",
    "equality": "Whole-horizon execution and concatenated continuation must produce identical final state, ordered physical trace, outcome and cumulative modeled costs, with only explicitly documented segment-envelope metadata differing. Check both a normal and a delayed or disrupted case. Export/import in the middle must reproduce the same continuation, including signals pending across the cut.",
    "paused_state": "Status, wall-clock waiting and export do not advance simulated time. Unknown/tampered checkpoints and stale revisions reject without rewriting committed state. Exact intent retry or interrupted continuation recovers once.",
    "scope": "Continuity of this stationary service habitat and moving courier is the admitted capability. Relocation of an entire physical habitat and construction are separate milestones.",
    "parent_preservation": "The original expedition collection remains unchanged. Preparing a habitat copies its checked frozen pair into a new fixed manifest. Candidate files remain available with parent hashes. This milestone does not claim new in-world growth or an evolving organism roster."
  },
